<p class="figure" style="page-break-after:avoid;"><img src="cid:6e2aa761-0545-4394-a376-5de6215b59b7.png" height="562" width="487"/></p><p class="FigureTitle" style="text-align:center;">Figure 32&#xA0;&#x2014; Impulse response of transmission-side IRS filters at 16 and 8 kHz</p></div>

