<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_086f3751-c8d6-1085-a38d-76ac26c8066f" id="_086f3751-c8d6-1085-a38d-76ac26c8066f"></a><b>Source code:</b> <tt>fir-lib.c</tt></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d5c605a8-df26-dd4d-c4f5-84f867279c09" id="_d5c605a8-df26-dd4d-c4f5-84f867279c09"></a><b>Description:</b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0c6b6689-6c08-0e7e-d6c8-d324c96e9baf" id="_0c6b6689-6c08-0e7e-d6c8-d324c96e9baf"></a>Clear state variables in <tt>SCD_FIR</tt> struct; deallocation of filter structure memory is not done. Please note that <i>fir_ptr</i> should point to a valid <tt>SCD_FIR</tt> structure, which was allocated by an earlier call to one of the FIR initialization routines <tt>hq_*_init</tt>.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e74b711e-f1fe-743c-79ea-77997ff986d7" id="_e74b711e-f1fe-743c-79ea-77997ff986d7"></a><b>Variables:</b></p>

