<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_f53e3a10-3b10-f688-02ea-24c575479682" id="_f53e3a10-3b10-f688-02ea-24c575479682"></a>General function for implementing filtering using a cascade-form IIR filter previously initialized by one of the <tt>iir_*_init()</tt> routines.</p>

