<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_0ea285bb-2b73-6b79-a9db-8cf94f51fcda" id="_0ea285bb-2b73-6b79-a9db-8cf94f51fcda"></a><b>Source code:</b> <tt>iir-lib.c</tt></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_79c77479-72f6-75d4-908c-6b603d818bad" id="_79c77479-72f6-75d4-908c-6b603d818bad"></a><b>Description:</b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_160de209-6510-bfcf-6b7a-34590c5df7e8" id="_160de209-6510-bfcf-6b7a-34590c5df7e8"></a>Deallocate memory, which was allocated by an earlier call to one of the cascade-form IIR filter initialization routines described before. <tt>iir_prt</tt> must not be a NULL pointer.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_90d1a65a-7a4d-e2e9-f3bc-e1bdb90925a0" id="_90d1a65a-7a4d-e2e9-f3bc-e1bdb90925a0"></a><b>Variables:</b></p>

