<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d829ba95-6b88-4ab3-6d48-96e8c2ce4134" id="_d829ba95-6b88-4ab3-6d48-96e8c2ce4134"></a><b>Prototype:</b> <tt>eid.h</tt></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_88911284-9311-6c3c-b81c-91fffc7e3347" id="_88911284-9311-6c3c-b81c-91fffc7e3347"></a><b>Description:</b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_c301711e-2c0a-9964-f8ed-bb6b4b03891b" id="_c301711e-2c0a-9964-f8ed-bb6b4b03891b"></a>Reset a <tt>BURST_EID</tt> structure previously initialized by a call to <tt>open_burst_eid()</tt>. By default, only counters are reset; if the symbol <tt>RESET_SEED_AS_WELL</tt> is defined at compilation time, the seed is also reset. However, this is not recommended.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_feb97bb8-cbcf-4b36-7d72-3640b320b53d" id="_feb97bb8-cbcf-4b36-7d72-3640b320b53d"></a><b>Variables:</b></p>

<div align="center" class="table_container"><table class="dl" style="mso-table-anchor-horizontal:column;mso-table-overlap:never;"><a name="_d5ad4140-a3f6-ef39-c6f5-8bc935ee7c67" id="_d5ad4140-a3f6-ef39-c6f5-8bc935ee7c67"></a><colgroup><col width="20%"/><col width="80%"/></colgroup><tbody><tr><th valign="top" style="font-weight:bold;page-break-after:auto;" width="20.0%"><i>burst_eid</i></th><td valign="top" style="page-break-after:auto;" width="80.0%"><p style="page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_98e3f87c-06ae-dcf3-a501-986bee7b0126" id="_98e3f87c-06ae-dcf3-a501-986bee7b0126"></a><tt>BURST_EID</tt> structure to be reset.</p>
</td></tr></tbody></table></div>

