<div><a name="_272847c7-0809-9dfc-293f-d64be649b6dd" id="_272847c7-0809-9dfc-293f-d64be649b6dd"></a><h3>15.2.6.<span style="mso-tab-count:1">&#xA0; </span><tt>BER_generator</tt></h3>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2cbb1fba-5051-bda8-604c-a1e16bfcaf38" id="_2cbb1fba-5051-bda8-604c-a1e16bfcaf38"></a><b>Syntax:</b></p>

<p class="Sourcecode"><a name="_ae5d080e-d785-1434-b82e-d3eb7b07910b" id="_ae5d080e-d785-1434-b82e-d3eb7b07910b"></a><span class="cp">#include</span> <span class="cpf">"eid.h"</span><span class="cp"><br/></span><span class="kt">double</span> <span class="nf">BER_generator</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="n">SCD_EID</span> <span class="n">_</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="n">EID_</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">long</span> <span class="n">_lseg_</span><span class="p">,</span> <span class="kt">short</span> <span class="n">_</span><span class="o">*</span><span class="n">EPbuff_</span><span class="p">);</span></p>


<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_7edf74d5-78b5-2288-706f-67febf551cd1" id="_7edf74d5-78b5-2288-706f-67febf551cd1"></a><b>Prototype:</b> <tt>eid.h</tt></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_47849fed-5e14-ebd8-7e5e-d07a2379b36c" id="_47849fed-5e14-ebd8-7e5e-d07a2379b36c"></a><b>Description:</b></p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_2813b9fb-9c0c-5b7c-4769-9729f53f8815" id="_2813b9fb-9c0c-5b7c-4769-9729f53f8815"></a>Generates a softbit error pattern according to the selected channel model present in <i>EID</i>. The introduction of the bit errors in the bitstream is done by the function <tt>BER_insertion</tt>. It should be noted that softbit error pattern buffers do not contain synchronization headers.</p>

<p class="MsoNormal"><a name="_e6d3dc70-f205-28ff-c778-f6b10f66e63e" id="_e6d3dc70-f205-28ff-c778-f6b10f66e63e"></a><b>Variables:</b></p>

