</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_d6c18372-3c3f-b1f6-922b-804f60cfbd58" id="_d6c18372-3c3f-b1f6-922b-804f60cfbd58"></a>a=b+c</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_a849dbaa-88b4-debe-129b-3387b1d1b4d6" id="_a849dbaa-88b4-debe-129b-3387b1d1b4d6"></a>1</p>
</td><td valign="top" align="left" style="border-top:solid windowtext 1.5pt;mso-border-top-alt:solid windowtext 1.5pt;border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt;mso-border-bottom-alt:solid windowtext 1.0pt;page-break-after:auto;"><p style="text-align: left;page-break-after:auto" class="MsoNormal"><a name="_ecca075a-167b-79ec-cda0-30bfdafd0074" id="_ecca075a-167b-79ec-cda0-30bfdafd0074"></a>1</p>
